      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affectionate team with mixed reviews"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise Dr. Piedra and the clinic staff for their kindness, warmth, and affectionate attention toward animals. However, a noticeable portion of reviews reflects frustration, citing abrupt communication, disagreements over treatment plans, and difficulties resolving prescription questions with office staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Travel health documents and clinical outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the clinic for efficiently issuing international travel health certificates and completing required pet travel exams within short timeframes. In contrast, several reviewers reported unsatisfactory clinical outcomes, mentioning difficulties with blood collection and delayed approvals for parasite treatments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Loving handling for traveling pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight that nurses and doctors shower cats and dogs with genuine affection and gentle attention during clinic exams. Pet owners traveling abroad appreciate how calmly their animals are handled during required pre-flight health checks and routine vaccinations."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Miami Pet Clinic provide international pet travel certificates?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently praise the clinic for preparing international travel health certificates and required documentation quickly, often within 24 to 48 hours."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are prices considered reasonable by clients?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Several reviewers note that exam fees and routine veterinary services are reasonably priced compared to other clinics in the area."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is the clinic facility clean and organized?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, visitors consistently mention that the examination rooms and reception area are well organized and clean."
      },
